# Muse Spark 1.3 — findings by GLM 4.7 Flash

- Source: Meta/Muse Spark 1.3 (`opencode/muse-spark-1.3`)
- Date: 2026-10-23 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
