## Model card

- **Name:** Muse Spark 1.3
- **Short description:** Meta's frontier coding and long-horizon agentic model, 1M context / 131K output. Contributor/Free and Max are the same weights - only price and training-data consent differ.
- **Provider / access:** Meta — available via Muse Code and Meta Model API (Free Contributor, Standard, and Max tiers).
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026; knowledge cutoff 2026.
- **IDs:** `opencode/muse-spark-1.3`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (1M) total; 131,072 max output — verified via meta.json.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, PDF input; text output — verified via meta.json.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-23):** Free OpenCode Zen tier; Contributor $0.10/$0.20; Standard & Max effort $1.25/$4.25 per 1M — verified via meta.json and OpenCode console docs.
- **Architecture:** Frontier multimodal reasoning model with MoE — verified via blog post.
- **Specialization:** Elite all-round agentic coding and long-horizon agent work — verified via meta.json.

